1
00:00:46,512 --> 00:00:48,663
[Woo Jae]
[No search results]

2
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:58,961
<i>Three, two, one!</i>

3
00:00:58,961 --> 00:00:59,987
<i>Done.</i>

4
00:00:59,987 --> 00:01:01,957
<i>Happy New Year, guys!</i>

5
00:01:02,626 --> 00:01:04,825
<i>Whatever Woo Jae is wishing for,</i>

6
00:01:04,825 --> 00:01:07,036
<i>please make it all come true.</i>

7
00:01:07,036 --> 00:01:08,245
<i>Please.</i>

8
00:01:08,245 --> 00:01:09,638
<i>Please.</i>

9
00:01:09,638 --> 00:01:12,208
<i>If you want me to treat you like a father,</i>

10
00:01:12,208 --> 00:01:14,001
<i>don't ever go looking for Mom.</i>

11
00:01:14,001 --> 00:01:15,861
<i>I'm warning you.</i>

12
00:01:22,218 --> 00:01:25,805
<i>Jung Woo Jae withdrew the deposit
for the dormitory and is moving out.</i>

13
00:01:25,805 --> 00:01:27,771
<i>He's quitting judo.</i>

14
00:01:29,350 --> 00:01:30,601
<i>Where did you go?</i>

15
00:01:30,601 --> 00:01:32,402
<i>Jung Woo Jae.</i>

16
00:01:37,548 --> 00:01:38,779
[Episode 3]

17
00:01:56,611 --> 00:01:58,517
[Best Actress Nominee]
[Yoon Ha Na, "I Was There in Your Night"]

18
00:02:13,342 --> 00:02:15,312
<i>Again.</i>

19
00:02:15,312 --> 00:02:17,134
<i>It's that day again.</i>

20
00:02:18,607 --> 00:02:21,819
<i>The same scene plays out again.</i>

21
00:02:21,819 --> 00:02:23,565
<i>Except for one person.</i>

22
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:27,528
<i>Thank goodness...</i>

23
00:02:34,665 --> 00:02:37,685
<i>Woo Jae isn't here.</i>

24
00:02:55,909 --> 00:02:57,519
- Beautiful.
- Ha Na!

25
00:03:32,932 --> 00:03:37,228
Now it's time to honor
the very best in Korean cinema.

26
00:03:37,228 --> 00:03:39,271
Best Actress.

27
00:03:39,271 --> 00:03:44,109
Presenting the award is last year's winner,
actress Lee Hyun Jin.

28
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:49,566
<i>The bastard could get in through here,</i>

29
00:03:49,566 --> 00:03:51,853
<i>here... or here.</i>

30
00:03:51,853 --> 00:03:55,496
<i>I've got security by the green room,
so no one notices you're gone.</i>

31
00:03:55,496 --> 00:03:58,123
<i>This is the route he escaped through.</i>

32
00:03:58,123 --> 00:04:00,513
<i>I had guards posted here too.</i>

33
00:04:01,794 --> 00:04:04,079
<i>Don't go anywhere near the green room.</i>

34
00:04:04,079 --> 00:04:05,756
<i>After the ceremony, go straight to the car.</i>

35
00:04:05,756 --> 00:04:07,254
<i>Got it?</i>

36
00:04:07,841 --> 00:04:09,221
<i>Yeah.</i>

37
00:04:15,015 --> 00:04:17,852
Hello, I'm actress Lee Hyun Jin.

38
00:04:17,852 --> 00:04:19,813
- Hello.
- Hello.

39
00:04:27,097 --> 00:04:29,935
[Actress Yoon Ha Na]

40
00:04:33,826 --> 00:04:36,036
<i>The awards are tomorrow.</i>

41
00:04:36,036 --> 00:04:39,623
<i>That guy will show up.</i>

42
00:04:39,623 --> 00:04:42,126
<i>Woo Jae has to be alive somewhere.</i>

43
00:04:42,126 --> 00:04:45,754
<i>Tomorrow, we catch him and go find Woo Jae.</i>

44
00:04:45,754 --> 00:04:49,425
The 30th Baekryong Film Awards, 2026.

45
00:04:49,425 --> 00:04:51,302
And the award for Best Actress goes to...

46
00:04:51,302 --> 00:04:54,680
Yoon Ha Na, from "I Was There in Your Night."

47
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,436
Congratulations.

48
00:05:02,729 --> 00:05:05,027
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

49
00:05:09,271 --> 00:05:11,405
Feeling that bad?

50
00:05:11,405 --> 00:05:12,740
Want to go backstage?

51
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,074
No, I'm okay.

52
00:05:14,074 --> 00:05:15,985
I'll go to the car.

53
00:05:20,456 --> 00:05:21,488
- Hey.
- Yeah?

54
00:05:21,488 --> 00:05:23,669
Did I ever introduce you to CEO Kim?

55
00:05:23,669 --> 00:05:25,085
Oh, is he here?

56
00:05:25,085 --> 00:05:26,879
- Where?
- He said he would be upstairs.

57
00:05:26,879 --> 00:05:29,256
- I see.
- He's with Producer Im.

58
00:05:29,256 --> 00:05:30,502
Yeah?

59
00:05:44,855 --> 00:05:46,502
Bye.

60
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,056
You can leave it here.

61
00:06:08,504 --> 00:06:09,553
Delivery.

62
00:06:09,553 --> 00:06:11,215
[Congratulations, Yoon Ha Na]

63
00:06:11,215 --> 00:06:12,925
When did this arrive?

64
00:06:12,925 --> 00:06:15,539
- Just now.
- The delivery guy?

65
00:06:15,539 --> 00:06:17,731
He just went around that corner.

66
00:06:31,994 --> 00:06:33,160
[Elevator to Underground Parking]

67
00:06:42,363 --> 00:06:45,102
- Great job today.
- You too.

68
00:07:02,494 --> 00:07:03,934
Excuse me!

69
00:07:04,899 --> 00:07:06,812
Wait.

70
00:07:06,812 --> 00:07:09,880
You delivered flowers to Ms. Yoon, right?

71
00:07:10,889 --> 00:07:13,268
Did you deliver them?

72
00:07:13,986 --> 00:07:15,864
Answer me, asshole!

73
00:07:15,864 --> 00:07:17,644
Answer me!

74
00:07:23,537 --> 00:07:25,989
Excuse me! Over here!

75
00:07:33,676 --> 00:07:35,704
Got you, bastard.

76
00:07:35,704 --> 00:07:37,462
Who are you...

77
00:07:53,774 --> 00:07:55,074
[Transfer]

78
00:07:55,074 --> 00:07:56,461
[Transfer to Real Love Capital Complete]

79
00:08:04,953 --> 00:08:06,406
<i>Yeah.</i>

80
00:08:06,406 --> 00:08:07,970
<i>I sent it.</i>

81
00:08:08,575 --> 00:08:11,794
<i>Look at you. So diligent.</i>

82
00:08:11,794 --> 00:08:13,853
<i>Yeah. This is how you pay it back.</i>

83
00:08:13,853 --> 00:08:15,661
<i>Good job.</i>

84
00:08:16,256 --> 00:08:18,550
<i>Hello? Hey!</i>

85
00:08:18,550 --> 00:08:19,885
<i>Who am I talking to here?</i>

86
00:08:19,885 --> 00:08:21,937
<i>- A little...
- He hung up.</i>

87
00:08:29,645 --> 00:08:30,729
<i>Careful.</i>

88
00:08:30,729 --> 00:08:31,897
<i>This looks so good.</i>

89
00:08:31,897 --> 00:08:33,941
<i>Tomorrow's Baekryong Best Actress nominees...</i>

90
00:08:33,941 --> 00:08:37,653
<i>- Did you see them?
- My money's on Yoon Ha Na.</i>

91
00:08:37,653 --> 00:08:39,593
<i>Ha Na in "I Was There in Your Night..."</i>

92
00:08:39,593 --> 00:08:42,199
<i>At the end, she's eating alone,
then zones out...</i>

93
00:08:42,199 --> 00:08:44,535
<i>and the tears just start falling.</i>

94
00:08:44,535 --> 00:08:46,745
<i>I bawled my eyes out.</i>

95
00:08:46,745 --> 00:08:48,789
<i>She really is good.</i>

96
00:08:48,789 --> 00:08:52,751
<i>Looks. Acting. She's got it all.</i>

97
00:08:52,751 --> 00:08:56,338
<i>But I heard she's been slipping lately.</i>

98
00:08:56,338 --> 00:08:58,257
<i>Like she's just faking it.</i>

99
00:08:58,257 --> 00:09:00,926
<i>They say there's no emotion left in her acting,</i>

100
00:09:00,926 --> 00:09:02,757
<i>just technique.</i>

101
00:09:04,513 --> 00:09:06,553
<i>Maybe she's past her prime.</i>

102
00:09:06,553 --> 00:09:08,642
<i>No way. I like her.</i>

103
00:09:08,642 --> 00:09:10,687
<i>Man, that sucks for her.</i>

104
00:09:12,479 --> 00:09:14,773
<i>Who's prettier, me or Yoon Ha Na?</i>

105
00:09:14,773 --> 00:09:16,452
<i>You, obviously.</i>

106
00:09:17,067 --> 00:09:19,444
<i>Want ice cream? I'll get some.</i>

107
00:09:19,444 --> 00:09:20,879
<i>Strawberry.</i>

108
00:09:25,935 --> 00:09:27,642
[Congratulations, Yoon Ha Na]

109
00:09:29,441 --> 00:09:31,580
<i>Goodbye.</i>

110
00:09:42,050 --> 00:09:43,594
<i>Ha Na.</i>

111
00:09:43,594 --> 00:09:45,888
<i>You did it.</i>

112
00:09:45,888 --> 00:09:47,449
<i>Congratulations.</i>

113
00:09:54,771 --> 00:09:55,898
What...

114
00:09:55,898 --> 00:09:57,263
Jung Woo Jae?

115
00:09:57,263 --> 00:09:58,849
Yoon Ha Ru.

116
00:10:00,611 --> 00:10:02,257
Woo Jae.

117
00:10:06,366 --> 00:10:08,702
Wait, don't get out...

118
00:10:08,702 --> 00:10:10,468
Woo Jae!

119
00:10:23,217 --> 00:10:24,905
Ha Na.

120
00:11:34,069 --> 00:11:35,111
Woo Jae...

121
00:11:35,111 --> 00:11:36,491
Woo Jae!

122
00:11:39,616 --> 00:11:41,063
- Emergency services?
- Woo Jae!

123
00:11:41,063 --> 00:11:43,255
- Woo Jae!
- Monera Hall, basement garage.

124
00:11:43,255 --> 00:11:45,090
- He's bleeding.
- Woo Jae!

125
00:11:45,090 --> 00:11:46,958
- No...
- Please hurry!

126
00:12:06,528 --> 00:12:07,446
- Please hurry!
- Oh my!

127
00:12:07,446 --> 00:12:08,613
- Woo Jae...
- He's bleeding!

128
00:12:08,613 --> 00:12:10,278
No...

129
00:12:24,379 --> 00:12:27,360
- I'm sorry!
- Hey! Are you crazy?

130
00:12:42,305 --> 00:12:43,506
Woo Jae.

131
00:12:43,506 --> 00:12:45,524
Stay with me.

132
00:12:47,527 --> 00:12:49,780
No...

133
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:51,533
Woo Jae.

134
00:12:54,623 --> 00:12:56,257
Ha Na.

135
00:13:05,128 --> 00:13:06,380
No, Woo Jae.

136
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:07,888
No!

137
00:13:09,641 --> 00:13:11,718
Thank goodness...

138
00:13:11,718 --> 00:13:12,928
No.

139
00:13:12,928 --> 00:13:15,385
No way...

140
00:13:23,455 --> 00:13:25,081
Woo Jae...

141
00:13:27,312 --> 00:13:29,786
No!

142
00:13:33,428 --> 00:13:35,454
No!

143
00:14:38,955 --> 00:14:40,565
<i>In other news.</i>

144
00:14:40,565 --> 00:14:43,759
<i>At Monera Hall's basement garage,
where the Baekryong Film Awards were held,</i>

145
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:47,814
<i>a man in his 30s was stabbed to death.</i>

146
00:14:47,814 --> 00:14:50,108
<i>The victim was a flower deliveryman</i>

147
00:14:50,108 --> 00:14:52,986
<i>who was reportedly attacked at the scene.</i>

148
00:14:52,986 --> 00:14:57,407
<i>Actress Yoon Ha Na was also
confirmed to be at the scene.</i>

149
00:14:57,407 --> 00:15:00,535
<i>Police suspect the attack was premeditated</i>

150
00:15:00,535 --> 00:15:03,413
<i>and are reviewing CCTV footage
and witness statements</i>

151
00:15:03,413 --> 00:15:05,290
<i>as the investigation continues.</i>

152
00:15:05,290 --> 00:15:09,951
<i>Yoon Ha Na is reportedly in a state of shock.</i>

153
00:15:47,573 --> 00:15:49,459
Yoon Ha Na.

154
00:15:49,459 --> 00:15:51,378
This is no time to sit around.

155
00:15:51,378 --> 00:15:53,585
You're not going to save him?

156
00:15:57,759 --> 00:15:59,553
Hey, Yoon Ha Na.

157
00:15:59,553 --> 00:16:01,263
We don't have time for this.

158
00:16:01,263 --> 00:16:03,723
It got worse.

159
00:16:03,723 --> 00:16:05,850
For over 15 years,

160
00:16:05,850 --> 00:16:08,995
he lived apart from us, all alone.

161
00:16:09,813 --> 00:16:13,306
He endured all that time by himself.

162
00:16:13,306 --> 00:16:14,840
And then...

163
00:16:15,433 --> 00:16:17,381
because of me again...

164
00:16:18,238 --> 00:16:19,489
He died because of me again.

165
00:16:19,489 --> 00:16:22,409
He died right in front of me,
trying to save me.

166
00:16:22,409 --> 00:16:27,372
And you want me
to go back to where he is alive?

167
00:16:27,372 --> 00:16:30,526
What can we even do if we go back?

168
00:16:36,923 --> 00:16:38,470
So?

169
00:16:38,470 --> 00:16:39,491
What?

170
00:16:39,491 --> 00:16:40,719
So...

171
00:16:40,719 --> 00:16:43,471
you won't save Woo Jae?

172
00:16:43,471 --> 00:16:44,845
I...

173
00:16:46,924 --> 00:16:49,577
I'm scared, Ha Ru.

174
00:16:51,354 --> 00:16:54,460
What if I lose him again?

175
00:16:55,150 --> 00:16:57,386
I'm terrified.

176
00:17:06,244 --> 00:17:07,996
I know.

177
00:17:07,996 --> 00:17:09,640
I know, but...

178
00:17:10,287 --> 00:17:12,118
not this time.

179
00:17:12,745 --> 00:17:14,669
This time is different.

180
00:17:14,669 --> 00:17:16,624
Jung Woo Jae...

181
00:17:17,756 --> 00:17:19,869
We can save him.

182
00:17:23,752 --> 00:17:25,758
What is this?

183
00:17:26,513 --> 00:17:30,810
The scar on that bastard's arm.

184
00:17:30,810 --> 00:17:32,088
What?

185
00:17:35,148 --> 00:17:38,642
Woo Jae knew about this scar too.

186
00:17:38,642 --> 00:17:40,710
What do you mean?

187
00:17:44,690 --> 00:17:45,992
<i>What is this?</i>

188
00:17:45,992 --> 00:17:48,244
<i>Ha Na's stalker.</i>

189
00:17:48,244 --> 00:17:50,372
<i>He has a scar on his wrist.</i>

190
00:17:50,372 --> 00:17:52,123
I know I saw it.

191
00:17:52,123 --> 00:17:53,500
And...

192
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:56,878
the way that bastard moved screamed judo.

193
00:17:56,878 --> 00:17:59,589
He definitely trained.

194
00:17:59,589 --> 00:18:00,840
Let's go back.

195
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:02,163
We can find him.

196
00:18:02,163 --> 00:18:03,885
What about the loan sharks?

197
00:18:03,885 --> 00:18:05,387
And his judo career?

198
00:18:05,387 --> 00:18:07,213
Got a plan for those?

199
00:18:55,353 --> 00:18:57,223
<i>Are we back?</i>

200
00:18:58,815 --> 00:19:00,734
There. All done.

201
00:19:00,734 --> 00:19:01,901
Should we sing now?

202
00:19:01,901 --> 00:19:03,486
One, two, three, four!

203
00:19:03,486 --> 00:19:06,021
<i>- ♪ Happy birthday to you ♪
- This time too...</i>

204
00:19:06,021 --> 00:19:08,783
<i>- ♪ Happy birthday to you ♪
- Yeah. I'm Yoon Ha Ru again.</i>

205
00:19:08,783 --> 00:19:11,953
<i>♪ Dear Ha Ru and Ha Na ♪</i>

206
00:19:11,953 --> 00:19:14,981
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

207
00:19:15,981 --> 00:19:17,080
Come on, blow them out.

208
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:18,688
Happy birthday!

209
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:22,079
Happy birthday!

210
00:19:22,079 --> 00:19:25,387
You put a lot of work into this, honey.

211
00:19:25,387 --> 00:19:26,734
<i>We're here.</i>

212
00:19:26,734 --> 00:19:28,678
<i>May 7, 2011.</i>

213
00:19:28,678 --> 00:19:30,096
<i>The third video.</i>

214
00:19:30,096 --> 00:19:32,682
<i>Our 19th birthday.</i>

215
00:19:32,682 --> 00:19:33,683
Okay, let's eat.

216
00:19:33,683 --> 00:19:35,727
No, wait!

217
00:19:35,727 --> 00:19:39,033
We still have the highlight.

218
00:19:39,773 --> 00:19:40,812
All right.

219
00:19:40,812 --> 00:19:43,276
And now, for our family's treasures,

220
00:19:43,276 --> 00:19:48,239
the twins' 19th birthday celebration show...

221
00:19:48,239 --> 00:19:50,649
begins now!

222
00:19:50,649 --> 00:19:55,413
<i>♪ Happy birthday, Ha Ru and Ha Na ♪</i>

223
00:19:55,413 --> 00:20:00,117
<i>♪ Happy birthday to our treasures ♪</i>

224
00:20:00,117 --> 00:20:02,077
<i>♪ Ha Ru and Ha Na... ♪</i>

225
00:20:02,077 --> 00:20:03,463
Come on!

226
00:20:03,463 --> 00:20:05,430
How old are you?

227
00:20:05,430 --> 00:20:07,249
When will you grow up?

228
00:20:07,249 --> 00:20:09,640
Look at all that dust.

229
00:20:10,378 --> 00:20:12,850
You're ruining my appetite.

230
00:20:12,850 --> 00:20:13,854
Wait.

231
00:20:13,854 --> 00:20:16,571
I cooked all this.
Why are you losing your appetite?

232
00:20:16,571 --> 00:20:17,894
I made all of it!

233
00:20:17,894 --> 00:20:18,937
Apologize.

234
00:20:18,937 --> 00:20:21,272
- Just eat.
- Apologize!

235
00:20:21,272 --> 00:20:22,690
If you don't apologize now,

236
00:20:22,690 --> 00:20:25,527
I can never love you again.

237
00:20:25,527 --> 00:20:27,362
Suit yourself.

238
00:20:27,362 --> 00:20:28,552
Let's eat!

239
00:20:28,552 --> 00:20:30,422
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

240
00:20:34,999 --> 00:20:37,270
- This is so good.
- Yeah.

241
00:21:17,829 --> 00:21:20,596
Are you really not going to say anything?

242
00:21:23,691 --> 00:21:26,824
Beats me. Do what you want.

243
00:21:29,799 --> 00:21:32,418
Dad.

244
00:21:34,899 --> 00:21:36,919
You're such a good dancer.

245
00:21:36,919 --> 00:21:38,725
Whatever.

246
00:21:38,725 --> 00:21:41,394
Someone says I ruin her appetite.

247
00:21:41,394 --> 00:21:44,105
Mom secretly loves it.
She always acts like that.

248
00:21:44,105 --> 00:21:45,875
She's never gotten better at it.

249
00:21:45,875 --> 00:21:48,035
If only she were half like you.

250
00:21:48,035 --> 00:21:50,149
- Right?
- True.

251
00:21:50,149 --> 00:21:52,864
Your mom's always been bad at showing it, huh?

252
00:21:52,864 --> 00:21:55,742
Mom must have been a saint in a past life.

253
00:21:55,742 --> 00:21:56,775
I'm sure of it.

254
00:21:56,775 --> 00:21:59,577
How else could she end up with
a great husband like you?

255
00:21:59,577 --> 00:22:00,994
Right?

256
00:22:04,469 --> 00:22:06,389
Want me to get ice cream?

257
00:22:06,389 --> 00:22:08,336
- Nougat bar? Walnut?
- No.

258
00:22:08,336 --> 00:22:10,058
- No, thanks.
- Why not?

259
00:22:10,058 --> 00:22:11,209
Then what?

260
00:22:11,209 --> 00:22:12,449
Red bean bar?

261
00:22:12,449 --> 00:22:13,575
Red bean bar?

262
00:22:13,575 --> 00:22:16,916
Dad, want a cold bottle of makgeolli instead?

263
00:22:18,344 --> 00:22:20,082
Ha Na.

264
