What?

540
00:40:40,782 --> 00:40:41,887
<i>Jung Woo Jae.</i>

541
00:40:41,887 --> 00:40:43,287
<i>What's your dream?</i>

542
00:40:43,287 --> 00:40:45,082
<i>My dream? To be a judo player.</i>

543
00:40:45,082 --> 00:40:48,243
<i>Maybe I'll make the national team someday.</i>

544
00:40:51,219 --> 00:40:52,651
Why?

545
00:40:54,785 --> 00:40:57,483
You said you'd pay me back for today, right?

546
00:40:58,542 --> 00:41:00,643
Then do it properly.

547
00:41:00,643 --> 00:41:02,659
Don't do it halfway.

548
00:41:06,641 --> 00:41:08,294
Make the national team.

549
00:41:08,294 --> 00:41:10,049
Win gold.

550
00:41:11,588 --> 00:41:13,673
- What?
- Go back to judo.

551
00:41:13,673 --> 00:41:16,666
And make the national team.

552
00:41:16,666 --> 00:41:19,371
Make everyone want to protect you.

553
00:41:19,371 --> 00:41:21,622
Live knowing you're that loved.

554
00:41:21,622 --> 00:41:23,496
That's how you pay me back.

555
00:41:32,204 --> 00:41:34,231
Yoon Ha Ru, I...

556
00:41:34,231 --> 00:41:37,464
Just do it! No matter what.

557
00:41:37,464 --> 00:41:39,249
<i>It's your dream.</i>

558
00:41:39,249 --> 00:41:41,529
<i>Say you'll do it. Please.</i>

559
00:41:41,529 --> 00:41:43,082
<i>Please.</i>

560
00:41:45,198 --> 00:41:46,719
Okay.

561
00:41:48,063 --> 00:41:49,841
I'll do it again.

562
00:41:49,841 --> 00:41:51,247
Judo.

563
00:41:55,025 --> 00:41:56,564
You promised.

564
00:41:57,241 --> 00:41:58,800
Okay?

565
00:42:00,227 --> 00:42:01,582
Yeah.

566
00:42:07,170 --> 00:42:09,381
He said he'll do it.

567
00:42:09,381 --> 00:42:11,034
Let's go!

568
00:42:11,034 --> 00:42:13,125
I'm starving. What should we eat?

569
00:42:13,125 --> 00:42:15,293
- Pork cutlet?
- I don't eat fried food.

570
00:42:15,293 --> 00:42:17,212
- Tteokbokki?
- I don't eat carbs.

571
00:42:17,212 --> 00:42:19,924
- You eat them all the time.
- When do I?

572
00:42:24,330 --> 00:42:26,880
If we don't make the national team,

573
00:42:26,880 --> 00:42:29,096
we have no future!

574
00:42:29,096 --> 00:42:31,155
- No future.
- No future.

575
00:42:31,155 --> 00:42:32,723
Louder!

576
00:42:32,723 --> 00:42:33,762
Got it?

577
00:42:33,762 --> 00:42:35,444
- Yes!
- Yes!

578
00:42:36,969 --> 00:42:39,602
What are you doing here instead of studying?

579
00:42:39,602 --> 00:42:41,775
I'm actually pretty good at school.

580
00:42:41,775 --> 00:42:43,071
Aren't I?

581
00:42:43,071 --> 00:42:44,088
I think so.

582
00:42:44,088 --> 00:42:47,200
Come on. You only did judo too.

583
00:42:47,200 --> 00:42:48,462
True.

584
00:42:48,462 --> 00:42:50,787
I didn't study, but I was smart.

585
00:42:50,787 --> 00:42:52,696
Of course.

586
00:42:54,801 --> 00:42:56,076
Woo Jae.

587
00:42:56,076 --> 00:42:57,352
Training starts now.

588
00:42:57,352 --> 00:42:59,121
But the dorm will take a few days.

589
00:42:59,121 --> 00:43:01,397
Stay at Ha Ru's place until then.

590
00:43:01,397 --> 00:43:03,453
No problem!

591
00:43:05,201 --> 00:43:06,753
He's here.

592
00:43:06,753 --> 00:43:08,380
- Hello!
- Hello!

593
00:43:08,380 --> 00:43:09,698
Let's start.

594
00:43:09,698 --> 00:43:11,049
Yes!

595
00:43:11,049 --> 00:43:13,929
So... our ace, Woo Jae, is back.

596
00:43:13,929 --> 00:43:16,096
And our dark horse, Yoon Ha Ru.

597
00:43:16,096 --> 00:43:17,820
Enjoy this hell.

598
00:43:17,820 --> 00:43:20,716
Whoever endures makes the national team.

599
00:43:20,716 --> 00:43:22,060
Training starts!

600
00:43:22,060 --> 00:43:24,029
- Yes!
- Yes!

601
00:43:31,935 --> 00:43:37,334
- Woo Jae!
- Woo Jae!

602
00:43:58,939 --> 00:44:01,191
Soo Hyuk, keep up!

603
00:44:01,191 --> 00:44:03,032
Soo Hyuk, keep up!

604
00:44:04,527 --> 00:44:05,862
Han Soo Hyuk!

605
00:44:05,862 --> 00:44:07,220
Move!

606
00:44:07,822 --> 00:44:08,990
Run faster!

607
00:44:08,990 --> 00:44:10,562
Push him from behind!

608
00:44:31,012 --> 00:44:32,677
Good! Push-ups!

609
00:44:34,508 --> 00:44:35,952
Yoon Ha Ru!

610
00:44:35,952 --> 00:44:38,002
Get your head in the game!

611
00:45:00,211 --> 00:45:02,764
<i>Judo has its perks.</i>

612
00:45:11,553 --> 00:45:12,721
Okay!

613
00:45:13,479 --> 00:45:15,265
Switch!

614
00:45:15,265 --> 00:45:16,746
Switch!

615
00:45:32,191 --> 00:45:33,509
What now?

616
00:45:34,735 --> 00:45:36,310
Let me rest.

617
00:45:37,989 --> 00:45:39,289
Hey!

618
00:45:39,289 --> 00:45:40,556
Go, go.

619
00:45:43,787 --> 00:45:45,828
With your left hand...

620
00:45:45,828 --> 00:45:47,005
Grab here...

621
00:45:47,005 --> 00:45:48,715
Grab.

622
00:45:48,715 --> 00:45:50,133
Like this?

623
00:45:50,133 --> 00:45:52,205
How do you do this?

624
00:45:55,925 --> 00:45:57,883
I got it like this.

625
00:45:57,883 --> 00:45:59,586
Hold it like this.

626
00:46:01,845 --> 00:46:03,369
Like this?

627
00:46:07,518 --> 00:46:09,369
Jeez...

628
00:46:10,348 --> 00:46:12,837
How am I supposed to do this?

629
00:46:31,045 --> 00:46:32,478
What are you doing?

630
00:46:47,901 --> 00:46:49,526
You okay?

631
00:46:50,780 --> 00:46:52,105
Yeah.

632
00:46:55,368 --> 00:46:57,151
I'll do it for you.

633
00:47:09,786 --> 00:47:11,339
Oh my!

634
00:47:58,313 --> 00:48:00,100
What?

635
00:48:29,447 --> 00:48:30,958
What?

636
00:49:01,326 --> 00:49:04,128
Oh, that hit the spot.

637
00:49:04,128 --> 00:49:05,828
I'm stuffed.

638
00:49:06,532 --> 00:49:08,442
Oh, one left.

639
00:49:14,777 --> 00:49:16,777
What's wrong with you?

640
00:49:18,132 --> 00:49:21,060
Just give it... to Ha Na.

641
00:49:21,851 --> 00:49:24,063
Come on, she's already had plenty.

642
00:49:24,063 --> 00:49:26,633
I barely got any.

643
00:49:26,633 --> 00:49:29,094
Here, Ha Na.

644
00:49:29,094 --> 00:49:31,861
Thanks, Woo Jae.

645
00:49:35,291 --> 00:49:37,094
This is so good.

646
00:49:37,094 --> 00:49:38,432
Hey, Jung Woo Jae.

647
00:49:38,432 --> 00:49:39,521
Here.

648
00:49:39,521 --> 00:49:40,807
Eat.

649
00:49:43,495 --> 00:49:45,110
That was so good.

650
00:49:45,110 --> 00:49:46,250
I'm stuffed.

651
00:49:46,250 --> 00:49:48,396
So full.

652
00:49:49,573 --> 00:49:51,739
Did I eat all of it?

653
00:50:04,097 --> 00:50:05,915
What do I do?

654
00:50:05,915 --> 00:50:07,893
How do I share a room with him?

655
00:50:07,893 --> 00:50:09,486
Then with me?

656
00:50:09,486 --> 00:50:12,937
"Woo Jae, sleep with me. Come to my room."

657
00:50:12,937 --> 00:50:14,160
Like this?

658
00:50:14,160 --> 00:50:15,519
No.

659
00:50:15,519 --> 00:50:19,895
If you do anything weird to Woo Jae
while you're in my body...

660
00:50:19,895 --> 00:50:21,563
Are you insane?

661
00:50:21,563 --> 00:50:22,989
How can you even say that?

662
00:50:22,989 --> 00:50:24,494
But you know...

663
00:50:24,494 --> 00:50:27,767
It's just sleeping,
but you keep thinking weird things,

664
00:50:27,767 --> 00:50:30,054
so I got nervous too.

665
00:50:40,788 --> 00:50:42,251
Move.

666
00:51:03,455 --> 00:51:04,953
Asleep?

667
00:51:21,531 --> 00:51:23,562
<i>This is weird.</i>

668
00:51:23,562 --> 00:51:25,619
<i>This is really weird.</i>

669
00:51:29,736 --> 00:51:32,526
<i>Oh, that hit the spot.</i>

670
00:51:34,174 --> 00:51:38,149
<i>What's gotten into those two lately?</i>

671
00:51:41,837 --> 00:51:44,160
I'm losing it.

672
00:52:31,996 --> 00:52:34,276
<i>What did you wish for?</i>

673
00:52:34,276 --> 00:52:36,372
<i>The national team trial
is being held this year.</i>

674
00:52:36,372 --> 00:52:39,498
<i>I want to make it on the team
with you, Yoon Ha Ru.</i>

675
00:52:57,444 --> 00:52:58,611
Like this...

676
00:52:58,611 --> 00:52:59,977
Grab like this...

677
00:52:59,977 --> 00:53:01,450
And then...

678
00:53:11,989 --> 00:53:13,768
- Morning.
- Yeah.

679
00:53:13,768 --> 00:53:15,235
Morning.

680
00:53:31,670 --> 00:53:32,818
[National Team Trials: D-23]

681
00:53:32,818 --> 00:53:33,922
Faster.

682
00:53:33,922 --> 00:53:35,048
Do it right.

683
00:53:35,048 --> 00:53:36,261
Good.

684
00:53:36,261 --> 00:53:37,574
Go!

685
00:53:37,574 --> 00:53:38,927
One more!

686
00:53:40,549 --> 00:53:42,897
Ha Ru, you're too slow.

687
00:53:42,897 --> 00:53:44,398
Faster!

688
00:53:44,398 --> 00:53:45,525
Vroom, vroom.

689
00:53:45,525 --> 00:53:46,884
Beep, beep.

690
00:53:49,905 --> 00:53:52,329
Han Soo Hyuk, get it together!

691
00:53:55,808 --> 00:53:57,972
That's it. Good.

692
00:54:04,769 --> 00:54:07,353
Do it right. Focus!

693
00:54:08,180 --> 00:54:09,882
Not bad.

694
00:54:09,882 --> 00:54:11,133
When you do it...

695
00:54:11,133 --> 00:54:14,095
Grip here, control the arm,
and bring your hips in.

696
00:54:14,095 --> 00:54:15,600
Pull the arm this way.

697
00:54:15,600 --> 00:54:18,819
Once you're tight, go in.

698
00:54:18,819 --> 00:54:20,017
Pull harder.

699
00:54:20,017 --> 00:54:21,048
Try it.

700
00:54:21,048 --> 00:54:22,370
Grab.

701
00:54:22,370 --> 00:54:23,396
And then...

702
00:54:23,396 --> 00:54:24,772
Like this, then step in.

703
00:54:24,772 --> 00:54:26,438
Bring your hips in. Good.

704
00:54:26,438 --> 00:54:27,770
One more.

705
00:54:27,770 --> 00:54:29,318
Good. Smooth...

706
00:54:29,318 --> 00:54:31,240
Start from this position...

707
00:54:33,982 --> 00:54:36,423
Come out. Come out.

708
00:54:36,423 --> 00:54:37,623
Out!

709
00:54:42,023 --> 00:54:44,089
That's it. Okay.

710
00:54:44,089 --> 00:54:44,929
- Got it?
- Yeah.

711
00:54:44,929 --> 00:54:46,294
You're doing well.

712
00:54:46,294 --> 00:54:48,219
You've definitely improved since before.

713
00:54:48,219 --> 00:54:49,837
Thank you.

714
00:54:58,681 --> 00:55:00,163
Ha Ru!

715
00:55:01,473 --> 00:55:03,972
Aren't you eating?

716
00:55:03,972 --> 00:55:05,021
I'm good.

717
00:55:05,021 --> 00:55:06,774
Go ahead without me.

718
00:55:07,648 --> 00:55:08,733
Hey.

719
00:55:08,733 --> 00:55:10,860
You sure you don't need to eat?

720
00:55:10,860 --> 00:55:12,904
Yeah, I'm really fine.

721
00:55:12,904 --> 00:55:14,233
Okay.

722
00:55:14,962 --> 00:55:16,975
We'll go ahead.

723
00:55:16,975 --> 00:55:18,034
Good work.

724
00:55:18,034 --> 00:55:19,327
Wait up!

725
00:55:19,327 --> 00:55:20,494
Seriously...

726
00:55:20,494 --> 00:55:23,748
Going to eat all the good stuff again?

727
00:55:23,748 --> 00:55:25,082
You slacked off again?

728
00:55:25,082 --> 00:55:26,521
Come on!

729
00:55:36,093 --> 00:55:37,955
Hey, let's go.

730
00:55:37,955 --> 00:55:39,613
Oh, okay.

731
00:55:55,410 --> 00:55:58,042
I want to do something with you.

732
00:55:58,042 --> 00:55:59,255
What?

733
00:55:59,255 --> 00:56:00,309
What...

734
00:56:00,309 --> 00:56:03,030
What do you want to do?

735
00:56:03,030 --> 00:56:04,246
Are you crazy?

736
00:56:04,246 --> 00:56:08,128
Before class starts, practice with me.

737
00:56:08,128 --> 00:56:10,169
Practice?

738
00:56:10,169 --> 00:56:11,295
Yeah.

739
00:56:11,295 --> 00:56:14,090
Why? Not feeling well?

740
00:56:14,090 --> 00:56:15,383
No.

741
00:56:15,383 --> 00:56:17,051
Let's practice.

742
00:56:17,051 --> 00:56:18,426
Okay.

743
00:56:19,257 --> 00:56:21,244
- Let's go.
- Yeah.

744
00:56:26,456 --> 00:56:28,119
Wait for me.

745
00:57:37,006 --> 00:57:39,770
<i>It's my life. I'll handle it.</i>

746
00:57:41,552 --> 00:57:42,887
<i>Would you have done that?</i>

747
00:57:42,887 --> 00:57:45,890
<i>If I were in the same situation, would you?</i>

748
00:57:45,890 --> 00:57:49,998
<i>Would you have said,
"It's your life. Deal with it yourself?"</i>

749
00:57:51,292 --> 00:57:53,252
I'm throwing you, okay?

750
00:58:10,255 --> 00:58:12,412
Hey, Jung Woo Jae.

751
00:58:13,709 --> 00:58:15,896
I did it, right?

752
00:58:17,171 --> 00:58:18,709
Right?

753
00:58:24,068 --> 00:58:26,338
Oh my Gosh!

754
00:58:26,338 --> 00:58:28,034
I made it.

755
00:58:34,181 --> 00:58:35,863
<i>Jung Woo Jae.</i>

756
00:58:36,914 --> 00:58:39,110
<i>Get up.</i>

757
00:58:39,110 --> 00:58:40,933
<i>Hurry, get up.</i>

758
00:58:48,244 --> 00:58:50,051
<i>Yoon Ha Na?</i>

759
00:59:15,594 --> 00:59:18,297
[Epilogue coming up]

760
00:59:41,197 --> 00:59:43,007
<i>The one I really like is...</i>

761
00:59:43,007 --> 00:59:44,727
<i>You want me to wear this?</i>

762
00:59:44,727 --> 00:59:46,059
<i>It's Yoon Ha Na.</i>

763
00:59:46,800 --> 00:59:48,697
<i>Private Yoon Ha Ru, reporting for duty!</i>

764
00:59:48,697 --> 00:59:50,370
<i>Wow, he just...</i>

765
00:59:50,370 --> 00:59:52,075
<i>I like you!</i>

766
00:59:55,216 --> 00:59:56,883
[Shaman]
<i>Let's switch.</i>

767
00:59:56,883 --> 00:59:58,540
<i>Our bodies!</i>

768
00:59:58,540 --> 00:59:59,678
<i>Ha Na.</i>

769
00:59:59,678 --> 01:00:03,497
<i>You've got the national team trials coming up.</i>

770
01:00:03,497 --> 01:00:06,983
<i>We came here because of Woo Jae.</i>

771
01:00:13,151 --> 01:00:16,070
[Epilogue]

772
01:00:48,093 --> 01:00:50,928
If you ever don't want to be friends anymore...

773
01:00:51,520 --> 01:00:53,626
just tell me.

774
01:00:54,713 --> 01:00:56,828
What's that supposed to mean?

775
01:01:00,035 --> 01:01:03,159
If you ever feel like you're falling for me,

776
01:01:03,159 --> 01:01:05,582
don't hold back.

777
01:01:07,112 --> 01:01:09,669
That's never happening, so don't worry.

778
01:01:09,669 --> 01:01:10,754
Get some sleep.

779
01:01:10,754 --> 01:01:12,160
I'm off.

780
01:01:14,495 --> 01:01:15,813
I'm serious.

781
01:01:15,813 --> 01:01:17,753
Don't bottle up your feelings.

782
01:01:17,753 --> 01:01:19,899
You'll make yourself sick.
